OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARail line closes for one day for
OL,4,Aengineering work
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are being urged to plan
OL,7,Fahead as rail engineering work is
OL,8,Fclosing part of the Brighton Main Line
OL,9,Fon Sunday.
OL,11,FThe railway between Three Bridges and
OL,12,FBrighton will be shut for the day while
OL,13,Fengineers carry out maintenance and
OL,14,Fimprovement work, including installing
OL,15,Fmore than 700m (766yds) of new rail and
OL,16,Fchecking track, tunnel, bridge and
OL,17,Fsignalling equipment.
OL,19,FRail replacement buses will replace
OL,20,FSouthern and Thameslink services and
OL,21,Fjourneys are expected to take longer.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
