OL,3,GNEWSARail line closes for one day for
OL,4,Aengineering work
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy McAuliffe, Network Rail's Sussex
OL,7,Froute director, said it was "vital"
OL,8,Fwork on "one of the busiest rail
OL,9,Fcorridors in the country".
